WEBVTT

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:35.940
<b>The legendary mercenary tribe, Renho. 
Elizabeth was in fact one of those white demons.</b>

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:41.080
<b>They lost their planet long ago, and 
they've been plotting to invade Earth!!</b>

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:46.040
Y-You're...

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.690
It's been forever, huh?

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:51.920
How many episodes has it been?

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:55.460
I love the air on Earth.

00:01:55.420 --> 00:02:01.430
<b>Space Ururun Homestay</b>

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:03.030
Why?!

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:05.940
Why is the Kaientai here?!

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:08.060
I'm glad we were able 
to make it back in time.

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:09.890
Make it back in time?

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:14.070
So you're also aware that 
the Earth is being invaded?

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:17.370
I missed my timing with the Taiga drama,

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.450
but at least I'm not late for Jin...

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:20.900
You're too late!

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:25.270
That one ended nearly half a year ago.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:29.530
We'll throw you down the stairs 
and end you, so hold on.

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:30.390
Wait!

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:32.160
He just finished falling to Earth!

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.340
One more tumble and he'll die!

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:35.000
Wait, Gintoki!

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.710
Is that Sakamoto?

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:39.540
That voice...

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:40.970
Are you Zura?!

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:44.050
It's been ages.

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:45.810
How've you been doing?

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:46.920
And you...

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:49.340
You've changed so much!

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:50.320
That's wrong!

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:51.690
Is this how cavemen used 
to greet each other?!

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:52.940
Are you really friends?!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.860
There's no point in wasting 
time on these idiots.

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:57.360
Get on our ship.

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.570
You have business in space, right?

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:02.050
How did you know?

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:05.200
Not good. The clouds are picking up speed!

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:06.400
Hurry!

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:07.870
Or else it'll be too late!

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:09.750
What are you saying?

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.970
Jin is still being released on DVD...

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:15.130
Stop talking about Jin!

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:19.930
Oh, no. It's raining.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:21.770
Come inside, Ken-san.

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:24.010
Th-Thank you, madam.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:31.230
Ken-san, your right shoulder's getting wet.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.350
Come closer.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.780
No, this is fine.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.190
If I let you get wet, the boss will

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:40.150
come down from heaven to give me a licking.

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:43.920
You're still worrying about him?

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:50.120
After his death, you were there 
to help me run the store.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.790
I'm sure you've noticed how I feel.

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:56.540
I know.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:04:01.540
When he died, he entrusted me 
to you, along with the store.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:06.310
So why won't you accept my feelings?

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:09.310
You're always so kind to me, 
but you never say anything.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:12.100
Why do you have to be so stiff?

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.730
How do you really feel about me?

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:17.080
Tell me.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.400
Why won't you say anything?

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.690
Say something, please!

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.690
<b>Sorry, I can't talk anymore for some reason.</b>

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:30.160
<b>Eeeek!</b>

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:33.710
Do you see the chaos in the streets?

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.000
The people caught in the sudden storm,

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.490
have had their faces replaced by blank masks,

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.960
<b>What is this? What's going on?</b>

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:41.630
and they can only communicate 
by holding up signs.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.630
<b>Uh, hell if I know!!</b>

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.940
What is the meaning of this?!

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:46.160
What is happening to Edo?!

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.820
Ana Hanano, is this what happens 
when someone touches the rain?

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:50.600
Ana Hanano?

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.690
<b>Back to the studio for now.</b>

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:57.690
H-Hey! What's going on?!

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.130
So many Elis!

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:03.180
One, two, three...

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:04.450
They've released the seeds.

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:06.320
Once their seeds...

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:08.910
Those clouds have covered the entire planet,

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:11.080
Earth will fall into the hands of the Renho.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.190
So Elizabeth and his brethren 
are responsible for that rain?

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:18.080
But first, how do you know about our plan?

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:23.470
The Kaientai have been all around space.

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:25.970
Of course we would know this stuff.

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:30.550
Besides, I'm the one who brought 
those monsters to Earth.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:37.470
Kaientai Space Log O month X day.

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:40.240
We've welcomed a certain 
government official aboard the

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.360
Kairinmaru to do business.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.750
O-Okay, I got it.

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:05.740
That's a deal.

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:06.460
Huh?

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:11.010
After an hour of silent dealing, 
we were able to strike a deal.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.380
Hey, Sakamoto. Are you sure about this?

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:17.920
Who is he?

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:20.810
Don't worry.

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.830
We both spilled our guts.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:27.070
No, you were the only one 
who was spilling his guts.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:31.130
Basically, he wants us to 
carry some cargo to Earth.

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:34.690
Is this cargo supposed to include 
a bunch of funky-looking creatures?

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:37.040
And when did he tell you this?

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:39.020
He spent the whole time wheezing.

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:40.830
While you were in the little girls' room,

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:43.710
he pulled out this sign.

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.800
This is a picture of 
Earth that's crossed out.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:50.800
He must have learned that Earth is in danger.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.530
And he wants to protect 
Earth from that danger.

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:55.640
Really?

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:59.330
It looks like he's got 
something else in mind to me.

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:04.460
So first, he must send his pets 
to Earth to serve as watchdogs.

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:08.170
Those watchdogs appear 
to be attacking humans.

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:11.320
The pets and their owners 
are having fun on a walk.

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:14.320
I was so touched!

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:16.110
I can't stop crying!

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:17.540
That's not called crying.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:22.130
I never thought that an Amanto 
would care so much about Earth.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.170
The Kaientai's objective was

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:29.970
to improve relations between Earthlings 
and the Amanto through business.

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:33.450
Plus, I have a bunch of points saved 
up at this hostess club on Earth...

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:36.810
Is there anyone else out 
there to take on this job?!

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:40.630
I now return to the mother planet!

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:42.310
To Smi-

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.560
To Earth!

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:46.950
The future of Earth is bright!

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:48.560
Wait for me, Oryo-chan!

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.870
How is it bright?!

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:54.060
It's completely dark because of you!

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:56.370
How could you do this?!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.960
You brought the invaders' 
spies right to our planet!

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:02.650
You're going to destroy Earth because 
you wanted to visit a hostess club!

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:04.090
They were dropping hints everywhere!

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:06.340
You should have been able to 
figure out their objective!

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:07.740
And how long are you going 
to stomp on him, Mutsu-san!

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:08.710
Where are you stomping him?!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.530
Most businessmen tend 
to suspect other people.

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:15.670
But I do business by trusting people.

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:17.640
You were throwing up the entire time.

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:23.520
Since his job is to carry diseases 
from space to Earth via his crotch.

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.190
Mutsu, I'm gonna kill you.

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:28.250
I did some research since 
I knew something was fishy,

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.480
and look what we discovered.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:32.210
Now that you mention it, 
this ship looks familiar.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:33.780
So this is that same ship.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:35.890
As we speak, the people of Earth

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:38.960
are being rendered mute by the 
transformation into Elizabeth

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:41.750
by the seeds that were spread by 
the agents we carried to Earth.

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:45.370
However, this is only the 
first phase of their plan.

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:48.290
Once communications on 
Earth have been disrupted,

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.920
they plan on launching a large invasion.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.270
We must prevent this from happening.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:57.830
No, place your hand over your heart,

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:59.640
and you'll realize that 
this is our responsibility.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:00.890
Don't blame us!

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.900
This is all your fault!

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:05.010
There isn't any time to whine.

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:08.940
We're the only ones who can stop this.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.440
I see.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:16.460
So this ship is a Noah's ark, 
the last hope of the samurai.

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:19.350
Kintoki...

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.990
My name isn't Kintoki.

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:22.470
Zura...

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:25.830
It wasn't coincidence that 
brought you on this ship.

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:29.920
We're the only idiots who are stupid enough

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:32.460
to pick a fight with aliens.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:46.100
<b>Just as planned.</b>

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.600
<b>In less than a day, Earth will 
be covered by those clouds.</b>

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:54.190
<b>My lord!</b>

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.400
<b>A fleet is signaling us...</b>

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:57.950
<b>What?</b>

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:01.080
<b>A signal that can't be picked 
up by the naked eye or radar?</b>

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:05.750
<b>This signal belongs to the 
ship we contacted before.</b>

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:07.540
<b>What are they trying to say?</b>

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:08.650
Business?

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:09.420
That's right.

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:12.270
The Renho are known as the 
legendary mercenary tribe

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:15.140
partially because of how 
difficult they are to find.

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:20.300
It would be far too difficult to find 
their mothership in this vast universe.

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:24.940
So I'll make them a deal they 
can't refuse and draw them in.

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:26.350
A deal they can't refuse?

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.690
What are you offering?

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:31.810
Those guys wouldn't be 
interested in any cheap deals.

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:36.650
However, they can't ignore 
the offer I've made.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:37.950
I'm selling Earth!

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.570
Selling Earth?!

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:41.910
They're on their way to invade Earth.

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:44.660
They need all the men and 
weapons they can get.

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:49.210
I'm offering the weaponry and 
manpower of the Kaientai.

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:52.380
They can certainly use the help.

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:58.340
Ironically, we're considered a neutral 
party because we helped them before.

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:00.550
This will help greatly.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:06.960
My razor sharp right-hand-woman can 
drag negotiations out for a day.

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:08.930
Earth can only hold out for a day at best.

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:12.120
This will be the biggest deal 
the Kaientai has ever struck.

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:14.260
So before Earth is taken out,

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:17.460
we'll take away their future!

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:26.560
This is Elizabeth's mothership 
and mother planet.

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:28.250
It's like a fortress.

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:30.800
There are so many Elizabeths...

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.880
One Elizabeth, two Elizabeths, 
three Elizabeths...

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:37.790
Stop that already!

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:40.750
If you fall asleep here, our 
operation will fall apart!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.340
Listen up.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:46.810
Do whatever you can to blend in, Zurazabeth.

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.850
It's not Zurazabeth, it's Katsurabeth.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.600
<b>Ginzabeth, you should use signs to talk.</b>

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.110
<b>One slip of the tongue and the gig 
will be up. So keep your mouth...</b>

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:55.810
<b>shut...</b>

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:56.480
<b>tight...</b>

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:59.610
I wouldn't call that a slip of the tongue!

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:59.610
<b>Blargh.</b>

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.610
<b>Damn, I forgot to take some medicine.</b>

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:04.330
How can you get motion 
sickness on such a big ship?!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.870
<b>C-Can't bear the smell of a strange new 
place. And I can't bear riding a ship.</b>

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:05.870
Stop riding these ships then!

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:09.370
Sakamoto! You still get motion sickness?

00:12:09.780 --> 00:12:13.160
I told you to open a window and 
look far away when you get sick.

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:14.530
And take deep breaths.

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:15.810
That's not a window you just opened!

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:17.750
You just destroyed the 
purpose of that costume!

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:19.240
Don't look far away!

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:20.990
Don't look far away right now!

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:22.320
Gin-san! Gin-san!

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:24.050
Can we hurry up?

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:26.490
All of us are ready to go.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:29.180
Sorry, let's go.

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:31.060
Hell no!

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:32.580
Say something, stupid!

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:35.880
Why am I the only one who was 
painted white with tighty-whities?!

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.690
Why am I the only one who 
doesn't get a disguise?!

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:40.760
Huh? Are you Shinpachi?

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:42.200
I didn't notice.

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.580
That's a great disguise, huh?

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:45.330
Yeah, don't worry.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:48.440
I didn't even notice you were here 
before you opened your mouth.

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:51.570
Perfect. You'll be fine, Toshio-kun.

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:52.890
Don't call me Toshio-kun!

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:54.920
And you don't want me to be Toshio-kun!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.580
Not unless you want to 
die, you three stooges!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.750
That won't do.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:02.090
My costume is a little big, 
so I'll let you inside.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.340
Where are you letting him in?!

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:07.970
The white devil is turning into 
Char's red Zaku, you dirty woman!

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:11.790
Kagura, let him in yours.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.090
Your costume is too big, right?

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:14.980
What? I don't wanna.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:18.960
I already finished customizing my Alzabeth.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.140
Five sukonbu.

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:23.400
Fine, I'll let you in for ten sukonbu.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:27.030
Is this any different from before?!

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:30.400
Shouldn't you cover my face and 
maybe leave my back exposed?!

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:31.890
Shinpachi is sticking out!

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:33.180
In plain sight!

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:34.360
Shut up.

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:36.730
It would be gross if you were on 
the bottom and your nose started

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:37.980
bleeding all over me.

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:40.790
I'm not gonna get a nosebleed 
over you, you idiot!

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.300
Eh?! What did you say?!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:45.300
<b>Hey there.</b>

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.390
<b>Hey there.</b>

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.800
<b>Are you mechanics?</b>

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:51.310
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:56.050
Damn! I'm the only one sticking out!

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.100
<b>N-Nothing important...</b>

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:57.980
<b>We were taking a break.</b>

00:13:58.180 --> 00:14:00.820
You guys are just trying 
to save your own asses!

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:01.730
Huh?

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:04.470
I think there's something 
sticking out of them.

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:06.130
How much of a rush were they in?!

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:08.180
What are you doing in those costumes?!

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:09.740
You're playing Uno, aren't you?!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.740
And what the hell is sticking 
out of your mouth?!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.040
How are we supposed to explain this?!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.750
What am I supposed to do?!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:22.670
<b>Hey, what's that sticking out of your head?</b>

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:20.670
Ah! He noticed me!

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:22.670
What do we do? What should I do?!

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:23.960
<b>A pimple.</b>

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.220
A-A pimple?!

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:28.130
What kind of explanation is that?!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:29.950
He's not gonna buy that!

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:31.850
Am I supposed to act like a pimple?!

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:35.890
<b>Mine is also a pimple.</b>

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.310
Don't join in!

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:35.890
Yours is something completely different!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:38.390
<b>Mine is Draw.</b>

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.390
Don't start playing again!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:42.900
<b>Too bad. Draw 4.</b>

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.040
Too bad none of you have any brains!

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.900
Stop playing Uno!

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:44.780
Why are there more sticking out?!

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:46.360
What kind of Uno is this?!

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:47.890
It's no use!

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:48.980
We've been found out!

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:50.410
We've so been found out!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.620
Thanks to these idiots, Earth is finished!

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:55.450
<b>We have a long journey to 
make. Watch your health.</b>

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:55.740
Huh?

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:58.920
Don't tell me that he bought it.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:04.500
<b>Hold on. I'll give you some Clearasil.</b>

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:01.970
He bought it!

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:04.500
And he's going to give us Clearasil!

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.590
<b>Clearasaw</b>

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.590
<b>This should get rid of it in a jiffy.</b>

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:12.090
Not what I was expecting!

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:15.920
Hey! What are you doing, foolish four?!

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:17.100
Stop! Let me go!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.140
Stop!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.830
I'm not a pimple!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:27.780
<b>You should feel much better.</b>

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.120
<b>It's almost time for dinner. 
Head to the main hall.</b>

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.200
<b>Roger.</b>

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.630
What am I?!

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:55.400
It appears that we've survived 
the first challenge.

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:57.600
We're in the heart of the enemy base.

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:00.390
But it will only get more difficult.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:05.110
In order to stop their plan, we'll 
need to dig deeper into the military.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:06.840
Look.

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:07.730
Are those...?

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:10.900
Those two generals are known 
as the Double Dragons.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:14.240
The Renho is made up of brigades 
that are led by captains.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:18.850
The entire army is led by the two generals.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:21.170
And all of Renho is led by the man

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:25.380
who went from foot soldier 
to supreme commander.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:28.470
The evil lord, Dark Vader.

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:30.880
He was the one who decided to invade Earth.

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.970
Dark Vader is the strongest Renho,

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:37.270
who became the supreme commander through 
a combination of strength and wiles.

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:40.980
He rules the Renho with an iron fist.

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:45.710
That is why we aren't allowed 
to reveal our bodies or speak.

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:48.570
Is that why you turned into a pervert?

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:54.490
The Renho have been reduced to a tribe 
of slaves for fulfilling his ambitions.

00:16:55.350 --> 00:17:00.320
We must defeat him, or there will 
be no future for Earth or the Renho.

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:03.500
If we can only find a way 
to reach his throat...

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:09.710
Oh, no! Stop talking!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.260
Uh, you're the only one who's been talking.

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:15.050
Don't take this banquet lightly.

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:18.140
Dark Vader is watching very closely.

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:21.360
If you drop a single grain of rice, 
you'll be killed on the spot.

00:17:21.360 --> 00:17:22.350
What?!

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:25.980
Don't worry. Just do as I do.

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:28.890
I'm getting really nervous.

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:29.980
Yay!

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:32.020
Look, Shinpachi. They have curry.

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:33.970
Don't start celebrating, Kagura-chan!

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:37.240
Please don't put natto on your 
curry like you usually do!

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:47.330
This curry comes with a 
red Excitebike on top?!

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:49.030
What's going on?!

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:50.030
What is this?!

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:51.270
Are they trying to ridicule me?!

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.090
Was it wrong to order the sweet curry?!

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.220
<b>Oh, you chose the sweet 
curry? You're such a child.</b>

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:01.640
The spicy curry is a black Bungeling Bay?!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.100
What's wrong with this planet?!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.640
Why do they eat Nintendo cartridges on rice?!

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:08.530
Hurry. Eat your food before it gets cold.

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:11.610
Okay, I'll admit that I've 
blown on cartridges before!

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:15.510
Oh, well. When in Rome...

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:18.690
Shinpachi, let's split this between us.

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:20.020
No, it's impossible!

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:21.790
This isn't edible!

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:23.100
It's a Nintendo cartridge!

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:24.290
It's only 8 bits!

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:26.970
You're only eating the rice?!

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:29.880
Hurry up, Shinpachi. Or 
they'll get suspicious.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:31.570
Hey, Shinpachi, Kagura.

00:18:31.570 --> 00:18:33.550
You don't need to eat that crap.

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:35.410
G-Gin-san!

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:38.300
This is what you feed your 
soldiers before the big battle?

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:39.960
They don't respect us!

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:41.600
They expect us to conquer Earth when

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:43.310
they don't even provide 
us with proper nutrition?!

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:45.560
W-Wait a moment, guys!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:50.310
<b>Do you have a Virtual Boy?
I'll have FF4.
Excuse me, can I get DQ5 instead?</b>

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:48.720
That's not the issue here!

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.310
And one of you is completely off!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:54.610
<b>Ah, found it!</b>

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:56.530
<b>So you don't have a Virtual Boy.</b>

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:59.450
<b>Yahoo! I want my FF4 Red Wings! But I'll 
probably throw it all up in the end...</b>

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:59.450
O-Oh, no!

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:04.660
Only captains are allowed to eat DQ and FF!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:06.950
So the captains also eat 
Nintendo cartridges?!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:10.120
And only the generals are 
allowed to eat Super Nintendo

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.330
games such as DQ5 and other FF games!

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:15.170
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:18.050
<b>You grunts dare to touch our 
Super Nintendo cartridges?!</b>

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:18.050
Crap! The generals have snapped!

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:22.460
What are you doing, you three stooges?!

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:23.470
Look out!

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:32.310
<b>Double Dragons, I apologize. Could you 
please spare them in return for my Actraiser?</b>

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:34.320
<b>What?! These are your men, General Eren?!</b>

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:36.070
G-General?!

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:37.240
How?!

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:38.900
I thought there were only two generals...

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:39.950
It can't be!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:40.950
<b>Yes...</b>

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:43.700
He was promoted for his work on Earth...

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:43.700
<b>I was about to recruit them.</b>

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.210
<b>You punks got spirit.</b>

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:52.580
<b>Interested in becoming my men?</b>

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:53.580
E-

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:56.340
Elizabeth!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:02.340
<b>I don't know how you 
found out about our plan,</b>

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.470
<b>but we don't need your help.</b>

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:08.040
I beg to differ, Dark Vader.

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:10.680
Earth will not fall so easily,

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:16.940
for there are unique warriors there 
that cannot be found anywhere else.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:19.080
The samurai...

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:26.200
I believe it will be difficult, even 
for you, to conquer their warrior code.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.240
<b>We also follow a code.</b>

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:33.460
<b>We Renho always wear white 
and keep our mouths shut.</b>

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:37.340
<b>Thus, have we established 
an identity for ourselves.</b>

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:40.010
<b>Mere samurai cannot overcome our will.</b>

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:44.010
I suppose. However, you will 
lose valuable soldiers.

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.970
<b>No matter. I have plenty more.</b>

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:48.260
<b>They are nothing more than tools.</b>

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:52.870
In war, soldiers are certainly expendable.

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:56.020
However, when a nation doesn't 
value the lives of its citizens,

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.430
it is bound to collapse.

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:00.130
You may have a new home,

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.990
but it will matter little if you lose 
the seeds for regaining your lost glory.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:06.780
<b>Why don't you test how 
useful my tools can be?</b>

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:08.450
<b>With the gun you carry...</b>

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:16.460
<b>It appears that you Earthlings are 
the ones who will lose their seeds.</b>

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:23.260
<b>I commend you for having the courage to come alone into enemy 
territory. I will grant you an up-close view of the destruction of Earth.</b>

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.750
You're the one who faces destruction.

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:33.830
You have no right to be a leader 
when you call your comrades tools.

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:36.440
Don't underestimate the 
planet of the samurai.

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:38.560
<b>I don't need soldiers or citizens.</b>

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:45.200
<b>As long as I have those, 
I can conquer the galaxy.</b>

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:48.160
<b>The samurai will soon learn</b>

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:50.450
<b>why the Renho Army soldiers</b>

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:55.210
<b>are feared as the white devils.</b>

00:22:03.190 --> 00:22:04.730
Renho Army?

00:22:04.730 --> 00:22:07.970
Don't you mean Renho Federation?!

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:10.010
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.020
<b>Next Episode: Piggy Banks and Trash Cans</b>

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:42.140
Next time:

00:23:42.140 --> 00:23:44.140
Piggy banks and trash cans.

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:49.400
<b>So that's why they were called white devils. 
The Renho Army was actually the Renho Federation.</b>

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:55.030
<b>Wait, what would have happened if Sunrise 
wasn't the studio making this show?</b>
